TinyStrata is an independent derivative of Niko1221/Strata.
Upstream: https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata
Base commit: 296b59d2f73c8f04a805df29c2fa97655adace78
Copyright (c) 2026 Niko1221 and the Strata contributors.
The upstream MIT license is preserved in LICENSE.

GGML-derived source and the pinned llama.cpp dependency are MIT licensed.
See third_party/ggml/LICENSE and third_party/ggml/VERSION.txt.
Existing file-level copyright and license notices remain in place.

The HTTP API server and tokenizer are adapted from the same upstream commit.

INT8 KV quantization and the dense prompt attention kernel are adapted from
aflin/momoe (https://github.com/aflin/momoe), an MIT-licensed Strata derivative.
Source commit: 47e5b2b2ab52982e105315bba2ac48ec75de01bf.
The dense kernel was introduced by Aaron Flin in commit
e5fd6d3acbe99f26ed7f179b6b35b8ec5343fb38. Original Strata copyright and MIT
license remain in LICENSE. Adaptations use TinyStrata's resident cache layout.
Native Q2_K/Q3_K expert dot helpers and Q2_K dequantization also adapt
src/kernels/cuda/iq_kernels.cu from the same MoMoE commit, with TinyStrata's
format dispatch and existing GGML block layouts. File-level attribution is retained.

Native FP8 attention instruction wrapper
include/strata/qwen35/fp8_mma.cuh adapts FlashInfer's
include/flashinfer/attention/sparse_mla_sm120/arch/mma_sm120.cuh at
38e6b8944fe8b6497d793ef21fbaadd797ea39d8 (https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer).
Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
BSD-3-Clause; full license and disclaimer retained in the adapted file and
third_party/licenses/FlashInfer-BSD-3-Clause.txt (include with binary distributions).
The surrounding dense scheduler is adapted from MoMoE, credited above.
SageAttention d1a57a546c3d395b1ffcbeecc66d81db76f3b4b5 was consulted for
FP8 accumulation design; no SageAttention source is incorporated.

The optional Qwen3.6 hybrid CUDA Graph handoff adapts Strata's mapped-memory
notification, device wait and host graph-launch mechanisms from
src/core/session.cpp, src/kernels/cuda/elementwise.cu and
include/strata/core/host_graph_launch.hpp at the base commit listed above (MIT).
TinyStrata adds native-expert miss merging, multi-token replay service and a
persistent launch worker. Original copyright and MIT license are retained.

Qwen3.6 native-server consumed-history tracking follows Strata Flash-Next's
src/program/generate.cpp at the base commit listed above (MIT), recording the
whole committed speculative prefix before emitting a potentially shorter reply.
